            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.17.0</h2>
<h3>Skins & UI</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>New Atelier skin</strong>: An adaptive Swiss-Nordic architectural studio skin (<code>#F5F5F1</code> warm <code>18px</code> dot-grid paper in light / <code>#121212</code> night elevation in dark) with a monochrome <strong>Quota Skyline</strong> elevation hero, inline active-tower callout pill, flat <code>0px</code> <code>1px</code>-ruled spec sheets contrasted against <code>9999px</code> pill tabs, blueprint cobalt (<code>#3848F0</code> / <code>#7C8AFF</code>) focal accents and corner crop-marks (<code>┌ ┐ └ ┘</code>), and click-to-provider navigation from overview towers and rows.</li>
<li><strong>Settings window reliability on macOS 27</strong>: <code>SettingsWindowBridge</code> now hosts <code>PreferencesView</code> in a dedicated reusable AppKit <code>NSWindow</code> (<code>Runic Settings</code>, <code>.moveToActiveSpace</code>, off-screen frame recovery) so clicking <strong>Settings…</strong>, <strong>About Runic</strong>, or provider deep-links reliably opens and raises the Settings window on macOS 14–27.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
