        <item>
            <title>2.16.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:41:05 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sriinnu/Runic/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>219</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.16.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.16.0</h2>
<h3>Skins & UI</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>New Meridian skin</strong>: An adaptive Swiss astronomical chronometer skin (Porcelain Enamel light / Grand Feu Midnight dark) with a 200° power-reserve sub-dial, tapered Dauphine hand, ruby cabochon pivot, calibrated railway gauges, and faceted status jewels. Replaces retired <code>Yantra</code>, <code>Receipt</code>, and <code>Retro</code> themes with automatic preference migration (<code>yantra</code> → <code>meridian</code>, <code>receipt</code> → <code>gazette</code>, <code>retro</code> → <code>relief</code>).</li>
<li><strong>Liquid Glass MK II, Relief MK II & Flight Deck MK II</strong>: Liquid Glass is now the default theme, with refined capillary gauges, tactile neomorphic wells on Relief, and upgraded PFD cockpit attitude/burn indicators on Flight Deck.</li>
<li><strong>Redesigned Settings window</strong>: Cleaner 820×680 split layout with updated Appearance theme previews, clearer General/Integrations structure, and updated CLI/MCP install paths (<code>Settings → General → Install CLI</code>, <code>Settings → Integrations → Runic MCP</code>).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Providers, Plan Tiers & Quotas</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Plan tier badges everywhere</strong>: Overview cards, skin headers, and <code>runic usage</code> CLI output now surface live provider tiers including <code>Google AI Ultra</code> (Antigravity) and Claude <code>Ultra</code> / <code>Max 5x</code> / <code>Max 20x</code> with preserved acronyms.</li>
<li><strong>Antigravity CLI (<code>agy /usage</code>)</strong>: Live quota scraping across all 4 model windows with ANSI stream plan-label capture (<code>Plan: Google AI Ultra</code>) and desktop fallback when the CLI is unavailable.</li>
<li><strong>Claude & Gemini fixes</strong>: <code>ClaudeStatusProbe</code> dismisses startup prompts and captures identity/plan banners reliably (<code>Plan: Ultra</code>); Gemini CLI <code>0.68.0</code> OAuth refreshes cleanly from <code>bundle/chunk-*.js</code> (respecting <code>GEMINI_CLI_PATH</code>) and explains Google's personal-OAuth deprecation with guidance toward Antigravity for Pro/Ultra quotas.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
